{"book":"2-kings","model":"glm-4.5","timestamp":"2026-05-03T08:21:36.387734608Z","verse":12,"ref":"2-kings 8:12","tier":"bulk","chapter":8,"translation":"And Hazael said, 'Why ⟨is⟩ my lord weeping?' And he said, 'Because I know ⟨את⟩ the evil that you will do to the children of Israel: ⟨the⟩ strongholds of them you will send in fire, and ⟨the⟩ young men of them you will slay with ⟨the⟩ sword, and ⟨the⟩ infants of them you will dash to pieces, and ⟨the⟩ pregnant women of them you will rip open.'","tokens":[{"surface":"ויאמר","gloss":"And said"},{"surface":"חזאל","gloss":"Hazael"},{"surface":"מדוע","gloss":"Why"},{"surface":"אדני","gloss":"my lord"},{"surface":"בכה","gloss":"weeps"},{"surface":"ויאמר","gloss":"And he said"},{"surface":"כי","gloss":"Because"},{"surface":"ידעתי","gloss":"I know"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"the evil"},{"surface":"אשר","gloss":"that"},{"surface":"תעשה","gloss":"you will do"},{"surface":"לבני","gloss":"to the children"},{"surface":"ישראל","gloss":"of Israel"},{"surface":"רעה","gloss":"evil"},{"surface":"מבצריהם","gloss":"their strongholds"},{"surface":"תשלח","gloss":"you will send"},{"surface":"באש","gloss":"into fire"},{"surface":"ובחריהם","gloss":"and their young men"},{"surface":"בחרב","gloss":"with the sword"},{"surface":"תהרג","gloss":"you will slay"},{"surface":"ועלליהם","gloss":"and their little ones"},{"surface":"תרטש","gloss":"you will dash to pieces"},{"surface":"והרתיהם","gloss":"and their pregnant women"},{"surface":"תבקע","gloss":"you will rip open"}]}